## 10. Implement and verify the core features


Offline Features (No Internet Required):
  Offline (matches Section 5.3's offline-continuity clause):
    10.1. Local identification: YOLO → crop → CNN → species, confidence, alternatives, all on-device
    10.2. Offline species library: query cached `FishSpecies` in Room
    10.3. Offline restricted-area check: `RestrictedArea.containsLocation()` against cached boundaries and closed-season date ranges, triggering a local `Notification` with no network call
    10.4. Local logging: `FishImage` and `FishIdentification` saved to Room immediately
  Online (matches the sync clause of 5.3 and BR10/FR-024):
    10.5. `GovernmentDataSource` scraper refreshes `RestrictedArea`, closed-season dates, and `FishSpecies` data
    10.6. `WorkManager` uploads queued logs and pulls the refreshed reference data
